he browser. Third demo on the right, **AudioStreamSynchronized (3)**, should produce garbled audio.\n\n<img width=\"1072\" height=\"680\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3032a92a-e3ba-4c96-a916-b535e7eb38c2\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[web-audio-garble.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21706166/web-audio-garble.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109494/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}